  "motion": {
    "notes": "Nothing on the reading surface travels. A card fades its border and background on hover or focus, the counter fades between its ordinary and complete colours, and the virtue disclosure opens under the source line. The same means the same colour transitions and the same final state; reduced motion keeps the colour change and skips any expansion animation.",
